  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-18413b8e-8685-4df8-a59a-22d5639f9165\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-34d2bd0e-b740-4d36-8f08-01d5bda684b4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-25295831-4e79-413c-b1fb-e923a66300a9\">*참고로 저는 제가 직접 수업하던 공부방을 2개월 전에 접었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_bubble\" id=\"SE-f2a8f965-1c54-4e2f-8244-f2393284b96c\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_bubble\">\n                            <blockquote class=\"se-quotation-container\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text se-quote\"><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b43270f9-ca78-4897-9854-46a17e33298a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-88a18f20-69ac-4295-9f43-4fee5d459a50\">수학 공부방 or 학원</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --></div>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-059d2c5d-9c40-4732-8c89-a72d2eceb118\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-da17e88d-3cc9-4239-bcbd-916adc3db3b8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dc9ab009-104c-4f8f-ba9d-8e5c4c71b462\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f9998a98-4bc7-449f-a278-92a6c9c2c82c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ea1718e6-53b6-4d6b-b5f8-8dc65458e3f4\">1) 하려는 이유 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ea7c0176-a97a-4e8b-bdbc-667f7c434daf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0c6c6cd1-90f9-4879-b697-3c99d3b90500\">- 지금 진짜 미친듯이 문의 오는중. 아마 방학이라서 그런듯 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d53b7fd8-89d3-49bc-bc37-c30f5431d755\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-319b6e20-86f9-4fc0-8a1f-be0447aed54a\">- 3개월전에 차린 수학쌤도 개 잘되는 중.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-82c1c2a5-32b1-4592-801c-1cdd0f849f97\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-802115e2-2dec-43e3-944e-db6ddee1e427\">- 무조건 6개월 내로 월 천만원씩 벌수 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f11d9066-326d-4be4-96ba-c311f70755b1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fc955cf0-bc71-486b-b3cb-a47334ac8999\">- 강의 수강생, 유튜브 구독자에게 실력검증?을 할수 있다??</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7b07700b-62e4-4fd9-ab9f-fbe042555cf8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bb8d53d4-067f-44ba-a9bb-d41e4da76a53\">- 강의자료로 쓸수 있음 ㅎㅎ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1e83d934-7c70-412d-9669-f364ad7f089e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9d204ee1-1d08-41ff-80b9-be56737877b8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2a98c8d1-4877-4f69-8fdb-a5de164fd0fd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5d71cf98-905b-4b77-a6c4-dedaec22ddce\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8da3c922-c4c0-4eed-ae23-1401d28250ee\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-950fbfbe-ce09-42ae-9fbb-69d635d56795\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-508fd6b2-1241-4fd3-a126-bb6394af73d8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4ce1fd60-1ba0-4694-a21d-61cdb2bbf079\">2) 망설이는 이유</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9c14d799-9bcd-4edd-bf0b-8c6b12f52afc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c4e1062d-c288-4a48-a267-4992c5af1e9c\">- 내가 수업은 못함. 시간이 없음.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-88772583-cf8e-4d10-9746-13cfa7e6bc3d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5ef43e06-f6b1-4fb3-bf59-78cff65154f4\">- 그럼 선생님을 구해야되는데 또 구하러 다녀야됨;;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b44fbb02-dc6a-4d55-b527-be5dc6f3e1a3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c50239b9-d1cf-422d-aaa6-7cc3602dd07f\">- 내가 수업을 안하기 때문에 선생님을 고용해서 아이들을 맡기면, 잘 되면 아이들을 데리고 나가서 그 선생님이 차림. 물론 이건 비율을 조정하면 되긴 함. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ab155853-573f-4640-9b1a-6a7005e24f19\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-43f7b5de-90fe-431e-8528-bae114cf98e9\">- 사실 가장 망설여지는 이유는 내 시간을 초반에 많이 투자해야 할것 같음. 상담하는 법, 아이들 다루는법, 시스템 이런거 다시 갖춰야 함</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27145ad4-0899-4dfc-a3cb-30cce8d4f4f3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5deeab7f-024c-49c6-8422-6f4766460fe4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-imageStrip se-imageStrip2 se-l-default\" id=\"SE-77e06b57-0dc6-475d-bcfd-e9a7fe4f7b2f\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-imageStrip se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-imageStrip-container se-imageStrip-col-2\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"width:49.869451697127936%;\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-5d64cbf7-856b-490e-8514-6a7a7a06c09b\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzAxMjlfMTc1/MDAxNjc0OTc1OTA0Mzkz.3FDdzb7FUuHPETkbiqNgaoun64h9eYPphh_LedP0EYMg.ziSOmb3PSrjPGs8YvL_QGOjo9xWbJXXmLo2-4AmkUFIg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"909\", \"originalHeight\" : \"219\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMzAxMjlfMTc1/MDAxNjc0OTc1OTA0Mzkz.3FDdzb7FUuHPETkbiqNgaoun64h9eYPphh_LedP0EYMg.ziSOmb3PSrjPGs8YvL_QGOjo9xWbJXXmLo2-4AmkUFIg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\