b-5283-4f78-afd8-4b1a92435bc1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-237be952-9073-4412-972c-aa5706934de1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1cd3e6ab-5626-4541-a648-1c0a4291393d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-60e068bb-ed33-49d2-8f86-75eda6e9f942\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9cfd647e-4b95-4fdc-8b8b-29009155c926\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-198a0583-647f-473e-aa70-9df005401b86\">한다면 세가지 방법중에 하나를 할 예정. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-89b66af7-a877-4640-93d6-c8a87eb92ee0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-92765fd8-ec68-42ad-8911-f5f1f298ec18\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5f5edf7c-f8bf-4f37-aaa3-57bc56fdf7ea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-63850a85-dfd1-466f-8965-87939ce1eaef\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f656b0bf-b096-4657-bead-7edde72439d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bdf71589-e439-4e39-9940-935c21adfcca\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d66e985-42b2-42af-a9ff-0bd67a9d6e25\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8c76a2ec-24b7-4d8f-824d-9f4fba30fc08\">1. 내가 상가건 오피스텔이건 구하고, 선생님(2명?정도) 하고 수익쉐어를 한다. (이 경우 양천구에서 합니다)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0091fb98-7c9c-4801-88ac-014de736f270\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c415e9fd-d883-42c4-977d-4e032251aad2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-71845d11-3623-4b27-8b58-acdf093c88c2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-56eafb8c-6b1d-41fd-82ca-f00addc6c439\">2. 그냥 초반에 컨설팅료로 천만원이상 받고 월 500이상 벌때까지 우리가 알아서 마케팅 해준다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a88726b-0e31-4487-914f-edce2d400a88\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-535f6ff1-d1cb-4443-bdb3-a2d272e78433\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-96fb46e0-5d35-4bee-a2de-c2e0b8e5c5d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-41c1df40-a126-4bca-a813-c8a21ad83d2b\">3. 1번 2번 중간 버전으로, 컨설팅료는 2번의 반정도만 받고, 수익쉐어도 10~20%정도만 받는다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5ca63d66-380a-414a-ae93-e6001f9ab3b1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f985a2eb-9225-4d2e-b1e5-b5fcc8f15252\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-baada7c7-e95e-4329-8f7c-e6e1b53e2993\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-286f65a0-88bd-464f-8820-816e504038ba\">*2,3번방법 장소는 선생님과 조율 예정</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-20e48e62-b0c7-4a35-9396-ed306aab73b4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1ca0546b-2584-4bbf-9c72-b480a8e697ed\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-line1\" id=\"SE-47987f4a-ed5b-42e0-8a9b-b387d922c507\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div cla